### Implementation steps (inside createOrganization)

1. Generate a secure random password (32 chars, alphanumeric)
2. Create account on climateai.org:
   ```
   POST https://climateai.org/xrpc/com.atproto.server.createAccount
   { handle: "${input.handle}.climateai.org", password }
   ```
3. Login with the new account to get an authenticated AtpAgent
4. If avatar provided: upload blob via agent.uploadBlob()
5. If banner provided: upload blob via agent.uploadBlob()
6. putRecord for app.certified.actor.profile/self:
   ```
   { $type: "app.certified.actor.profile", displayName, description, website?, avatar?, banner?, createdAt }
   ```
   Avatar format: `{ $type: "org.hypercerts.defs#smallImage", image: { $type: "blob", ref, mimeType, size } }`
   Banner format: `{ $type: "org.hypercerts.defs#largeImage", image: { ref, size, mimeType, original: { $type: "blob", ref, mimeType, size } } }`
7. putRecord for app.certified.actor.organization/self:
   ```
   { $type: "app.certified.actor.organization", organizationType, foundedDate?, urls?, createdAt }
   ```
   Location is a ref to app.certified.location — skip for now if no coordinates
8. putRecord for app.gainforest.organization.info/self:
   ```
   { $type: "app.gainforest.organization.info", displayName, shortDescription (first sentence of description), longDescription (full description), country, objectives?, website?, visibility: "public", startDate?, createdAt }
   ```
9. If memberName provided: createRecord for app.gainforest.organization.member:
   ```
   { $type: "app.gainforest.organization.member", displayName: memberName, firstName?, lastName?, role: memberRole, email?, languages?, expertise?, isPublic: true, createdAt }
   ```
   Parse firstName/lastName from memberName by splitting on last space.
10. Return { success: true, did, handle, password, profileUri, orgUri }

